{"unit_id":"tag:0F12:proof","translation":"由《位点上同调（Cohomology on Sites）》第 <REF_0001> 节，有从右到左的典范映射（canonical map）。\n设 <MATH_0001> 是引理的陈述对 <MATH_0002> 成立这一性质。\n我们将检查《代数（Algebra）的进一步讨论》注 <REF_0002>\n的条件 (1)、(2) 和 (3)\n对 <MATH_0003> 成立，从而得出结论。\n性质 (1) 成立，是因为等式两边都\n与直和（direct sums）交换（commute），见\n引理 <REF_0003>。\n性质 (2) 成立，是因为我们比较的是三角（triangulated）范畴（categories）之间的正合（exact）函子（functors），可用\n《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》引理 <REF_0004>。\n性质 (3) 是说，引理在 <MATH_0004> 时对任意移位（shift）<MATH_0005> 成立，这是显然的。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Cohomology on Sites","target_term":"位点上同调"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"direct sums","target_term":"直和"},{"source_term":"commute","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"triangulated","target_term":"三角"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"shift","target_term":"移位"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Cohomology on Sites","target_term":"位点上同调","context":"词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射","context":"词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"direct sums","target_term":"直和","context":"词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"commute","target_term":"交换","context":"词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"triangulated","target_term":"三角","context":"词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子","context":"词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"词表未批准。"},{"source_term":"shift","target_term":"移位","context":"词表未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
